# Grounded schematic obligations, not a parser for analysis.
context CauchyCDF
atom OffSupport Nonzero Continuous FiniteMeasure AESupport Integrable Formula
assumption OffSupport FiniteMeasure AESupport
available OffSupport FiniteMeasure AESupport
rule exclude: OffSupport -> Nonzero
rule reciprocal: Nonzero -> Continuous
rule compactSupport: Continuous & FiniteMeasure & AESupport -> Integrable
rule layerCakeFTC: Integrable & Nonzero & AESupport & FiniteMeasure -> Formula
goal Formula
